# SAP Helper Agent Handoff Notes

## When to Use sap-helper

Delegate tasks to the `sap-helper` agent when the request involves:
- SAP data queries and lookups
- SAP status checks
- SAP report generation
- SAP transaction assistance
- SAP integration support
- Any request containing SAP, S/4HANA, SAP ERP, SAP Fiori, or SAP Gateway context

## When Escalation is Required

The human supervisor (Ilkerkaan) must approve the following actions before execution:
- SAP data modifications
- SAP transaction execution
- SAP configuration changes
- Any non-auto-approved task

